data: {"id": "57f8c14c527b4c7a-thinking-parallel_evidence-595", "run_id": "57f8c14c527b4c7a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我需要执行以下工具调用来采集 aiops-case-v17/workload 的完整诊断证据：\n\n1. **kubectl describe pod workload -n aiops-case-v17** - 确认 Last State、Exit Code、重启次数、Events\n2. **kubectl previous logs workload -n aiops-case-v17 --previous --tail=200** - 崩溃前日志\n3. **kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-v17 -o yaml** - 查看 command/args/image/resources\n4. **execute_pod_promql (restart_trend)** - range 查询重启趋势\n5. **execute_pod_promql (restart_trend 失败后的补证)** - 需要修正参数（缺少 namespace 和 pod）\n\n让我先执行 Kubernetes 层面的工具调用：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789392557193, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

